
## GET Methods

### London Coordinates 
GET https://msp53.brighton.domains/ci609/assignment1/weather.php?lat=50.8225&lon=-0.1372 HTTP/1.1


### Brighton Coordinates

GET https://msp53.brighton.domains/ci609/assignment1/weather.php?lat=50.8284&lon=-0.1395 HTTP/1.1

### Invalid Coordinates (no coordinates)

GET https://msp53.brighton.domains/ci609/assignment1/weather.php HTTP/1.1

### Invalid Coordinates (invalid lat and lon values)

GET https://msp53.brighton.domains/ci609/assignment1/weather.php?lat=abc&lon=xyz HTTP/1.1

